cards.effect:
[AUTO]:When this unit is placed on (RC), if you have a vanguard with "Maebara Keiichi" in its card name, your opponent looks at the top card of their deck, and declares either trigger unit or not. COST [Say "You're Lying!"], and your opponent reveals the top card of their deck. If the revealed card matches the card type your opponent declared, draw a card. If you did not draw a card, put the revealed card on the bottom of your opponent's deck, and this unit gets [Power]+10000 until end of turn.
]AUTO](RC):At the end of the battle this unit attacked, if you have a vanguard with "Maebara Keiichi" in its card name, and you do not have a rear-guard with the same card name as this unit, COST [Soul Blast (1) & put this unit into soul], and draw a card.
[ACT][Soul]:If you have a vanguard with "Maebara Keiichi" in its card name, and you do not have a rear-guard with the same card name as this card, COST [Counter Blast (1)], and call this card to (RC).
